/// * `hash` must be one of 1..=7.
/// * `digest_len` must be the length of `hash`'s values: 20 for SHA-1, 28 for SHA-224 and SHA-512/224, 32 for SHA-256 and SHA-512/256, 48 for SHA-384, 64 for SHA-512.
